TITLE Ba-Sulfate solution temperature ramp with Barite equilibrium

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mg/L
    Ba        2.0
    S(6)      15.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Barite    0.0   0.0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25.0  39.0  53.0  67.0  81.0  95.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     ba_sulfate4.out
    -reset    false
    -temperature  true
    -step         true
    -sim          true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings  Step Temp SC
    -start
10  PUNCH STEP_NO
20  PUNCH TC
30  PUNCH SC
    -end

END
